			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Air intake control icon</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Air conditioning <term translate="no">A/C</term> icon</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p> <term translate="no">AUTO</term> (automatic control) icon</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Driver’s side temperature control lever</p>
			</li>
			<li>
